    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、1:1方形画幅的三维动画居家空间短片，采用三维动画风格\" (Generate a 15-second, 1:1 square format 3D animation home space short film in 3D animation style).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The frames depict a modern kitchen/dining scene with clean, crisp visuals.\n- Lighting is natural and consistent, with warm sunlight streaming through windows.\n- Textures on wood surfaces (cabinets, table) are well-rendered; overall rendering quality is high.\n- The camera work remains stable across shots, with smooth transitions and minimal artifacts.\n- Overall visual quality is strong and coherent throughout the sequence.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The prompt specifies a 15-second, 1:1 square format 3D animation home space short film in 3D animation style. The produced content aligns with these elements: it is clearly a 3D animated home interior, shown in a 1:1 aspect ratio, and the duration appears to be around 15 seconds.\n- The scene includes a woman in a beige sweater and white pants, a wooden tray/plate, a modern kitchen with white cabinets, a central island, a dining area with chairs, and natural lighting from windows, all rendered in a cohesive 3D animation style.\n- The alignment with the prompt is strong overall, with no major deviations detected.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency Analysis:\n- Movements and interactions feel natural: the woman handles the tray smoothly, and spatial relationships between objects remain plausible.\n- Lighting and shadows stay consistent, supporting a believable environment.\n- There are minor inconsistencies in hand positioning during the tray interaction, but they do not significantly disrupt realism or coherence of the scene.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- Visual Quality: 4\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4\n- Physical/Common-sense Consistency: 3\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
